{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1527142","title":"Mechanisms insights into stable nitrogen removal and sustained NOB photoinhibition in a photo-rotating biological contactor enhanced PN-algal symbiotic system under dual low temperature and low-ammonia stress","description":"To address the issues of nitrite-oxidizing bacteria (NOB) reactivation and instability in traditional partial nitrification (PN) under low temperature and low NH4+-N conditions, while suspended algal-bacterial symbiotic systems with NOB inhibition potential suffer from severe light shading and are difficult to engineer, this study constructed a blue light irradiated photo-rotating biological contactor coupled with PN-algal symbiosis system to explore the stability of nitrogen transformation, microbial succession and metabolic regulation mechanisms under low-temperature and low-NH4+-N stress.","center":"Suzhou University of Science and Technology","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/09/11 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN63069766","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-08-14",2025,"CN","Jiangsu",1886760,"Suzhou","verified",31.3068,120.5602,"China:Suzhou","sluge",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN63069767","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-09-13",2025,"CN","Jiangsu",1886760,"Suzhou","verified",31.3068,120.5602,"China:Suzhou","sluge",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN63069768","Metagenome or environmental sample from sludge metagenome","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2025-10-13",2025,"CN","Jiangsu",1886